                        <th scope="row">Makoid–Banakar</th>
                        <td>F = k<sub>MB</sub>·t<sup>n</sup>·e<sup>−k·t</sup></td>
                        <td>Tlag</td>
                        <td>Ampirik; tepe yapıp düşebilen eğri (Makoid et al., 1993). k ≈ 0 ise Korsmeyer–Peppas'a
